00:11:57.510 --> 00:12:01.570
So in essence, it's a
big challenge for us,

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:04.470
but as the technology
keeps improving

00:12:04.470 --> 00:12:07.800
you get this influx of
exciting new opportunities.

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:12.270
And our attitude is we want to
work with these cutting-edge

00:12:12.270 --> 00:12:15.600
possibilities and just keep
exploring and seeing what we

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:16.650
can figure out--

00:12:16.650 --> 00:12:19.050
