proof of concepts,

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:22.170
and hopefully if something
really sticks and shows

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:24.930
promise, to then expand
that into a business

00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:28.249
as usual type of possibility.

