MANJUNATH DEVADAS:
And when you think

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:32.430
of businesses like AB InBev--

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:34.720
and to me, it was
a bit overwhelming

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:38.590
when we showed up at their plant
to take a visit to the plant.

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:40.080
I have some of my
colleagues here

00:12:40.080 --> 00:12:41.985
