00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:47.934
Now think about a
production downtime impact.

00:12:47.934 --> 00:12:49.350
You're trying to
replace a filter,

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:51.550
and you have to
bring down a line.

00:12:51.550 --> 00:12:53.300
Think about the trucks
that are coming in.

00:12:53.300 --> 00:12:56.820
Think about the packaging, and
the human resource, the labor,

00:12:56.820 --> 00:12:59.160
